no=\"0\" hash=\"a4bc81e960efd0a637f3e9ff39da3717\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:141px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-First_floor-JPG\" style=\"position: relative; height:139px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"1 Dragon\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"1 \" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/First_floor_ad88b2.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"First floor.JPG (100 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:141px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Second_FLood-JPG\" style=\"position: relative; height:139px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"2 Dragons\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"2 \" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Second_FLood_f3e150.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Second FLood.JPG (103 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:141px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Third_floor-JPG\" style=\"position: relative; height:139px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"4 Dragons and 2 Dragon Lords\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"4  and  2 \" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Third_floor_69803e.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Third floor.JPG (121 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and  2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a></div></div></div>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Demodras\">Demodras</a> occasionally spawns on the third floor. You can also find here daily spawns of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Hammer\">War Hammer</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\nThis cave is really not a great place to hunt by itself, but you will often see <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> who hunt Giant Spiders in PoH hunting in this cave as well. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 65 pally with a decent amount of supplies could clear this cave easily, luring one thing at a time. Or a 80+ <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knight</a> could also clear it easily, although with a lot more waste.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\"><img alt=\"Fire Devil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Devil_3b556a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devil</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">145</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">180 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">35 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">145 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\